  "findings": [
    "All Studio tabs have actual model data; TGSlots correctly shows no applicable paylines. Physical strips and independent cell matrices remain distinct.",
    "Lower payout cap/pruning, line editor, dictionary and test evidence are visible through page/internal scrolling, with persistent source status.",
    "Diagram and transition table expose the same ordered guards/destinations. Source/actions/effects/private and shared variables/budget/definition uses were inspected through the entire inspector.",
    "Create/reuse dialogs preserve readable titles, labels and bottom actions on desktop and phone.",
    "Invalid integer error initially wrapped into a 57px column and overlapped the next outcome. Final CSS stacks only the invalid outcome row; full-size lower captures show 246\u2013290px message width, 54px height and disabled Apply.",
